<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schroder Wertheim &amp; Co said it downgraded Freeport-McMoRan Inc to &quot;perform in line&quot; from &quot;outperform.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Freeport-McMoRan lost 1/8 to 28.</p>
</text>
